Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new 10 lakh car can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,lose up to 30 percent in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,its first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You still owe the bank every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But the car is already worth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,much less.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Picture the showroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A red ribbon on the bonnet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,sweets for the staff,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole family smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody in that room talks about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,what this car will really cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The salesman talks about mileage and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The bank agent talks about an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,easy EMI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But the real bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That starts the moment you drive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest cost of a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is not petrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not service either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It is something you will never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,see printed on any bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the value quietly leaking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,out of your car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The car looks exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:01:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your money locked inside it does
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And then comes the big question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you pay with a loan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,or in cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Most families decide it at the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,showroom desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,3 questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How fast does a car lose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,value?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it really cost to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,own one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And loan or cash,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.57,0:01:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,which one is smarter for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.61,0:01:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a bonus answer most
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,people never even consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A smarter way to own a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.21,0:01:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,car that skips the biggest loss
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How fast does a car lose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,value?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us start with a word
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you will hear again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,today:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,depreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Depreciation simply means the fall in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,your car's price as it gets
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,older.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It is what you paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,minus what someone will pay you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of a new phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.23,0:02:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The day you open the box,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,its resale price drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A car works the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,only the loss is in lakhs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports say a car loses 15
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to 20 percent of its value
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,yearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That is just from age,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,daily use,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and normal wear and tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has to go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first year is the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,cruellest of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But a new car can drop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,up to 30 percent that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment the car is registered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,in your name,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it stops being new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It becomes a used car,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,on paper and in every buyer's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A used car buyer knows this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He will never pay the showroom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even if you drove it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,for a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stretch this over 5 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,At 15 to 20 percent a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,more than half the value can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,without a single scratch or accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine a family in Pune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They buy a 10 lakh car,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,drive it carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and service it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,5 years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,they try to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The dealer walks around it and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,kicks a tyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he offers well under half
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,of what they paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The father is stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The car still runs perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But the dealer is not cheating
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is simply how car prices
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The car is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Its price is what fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The family just never counted that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So here is the uncomfortable truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Every month you own a new
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,car,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,some of your money quietly melts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,no SMS,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,no warning at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.14,0:03:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If the value falls anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is depreciation really the biggest cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is petrol worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.89,0:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us open the full bill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Second question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it really cost to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,own a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the showroom price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The full bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,every year it stands in your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.91,0:04:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people count only petrol and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the EMI.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That is like judging a wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,budget only by the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The real list is much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the full list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Depreciation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,service and repairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,parking,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,interest on the loan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and then fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuel comes last on this list
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Studies of car costs report something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For the average owner,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,depreciation is about 50 percent of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,running costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigger than anything else on the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Half of everything you spend on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,a car is just its price
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not petrol,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,not service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the car getting older in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,your parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then comes insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Under Indian rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a new car needs third-party insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,for 3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And you pay all of it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,upfront,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,at the time of purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Third-party insurance covers damage you cause
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to other people or their property.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is compulsory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And it is a big cheque
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,on the very first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage to your own car needs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.89,0:05:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,a separate cover,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,renewed every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So insurance never really ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes back every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,like a birthday you did not
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there is service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every few thousand kilometres,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the car visits the workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oil,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,filters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,brakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,tyres.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Small bills,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but they never stop coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now notice something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Depreciation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,service and loan interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay all of these even
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,if the car sits at home
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain or shine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,used or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,These are called fixed costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They do not care how much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuel is the only big cost
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that moves with your actual driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So when someone boasts about great
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,mileage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,just smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good mileage saves you a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The big money is lost long
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,before you reach the petrol pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the family in Pune?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They tracked every petrol bill for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,5 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But they never once tracked the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,value leaking out of the car
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So the car costs far more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,than its sticker price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But now comes a decision that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,can add even more to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:06:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Third question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Loan or cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where most families get
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the maths wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,without even noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us slow down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,know that you are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Reportedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,over 85 percent of new cars
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,are bought on a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with full cash upfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because a loan feels easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay a small down payment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and drive out with the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The big amount feels far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,somewhere in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That big amount comes as the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,EMI,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,your fixed monthly loan payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Each EMI mixes a piece of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the car's price with the bank's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Month after month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Interest is the bank's fee for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,lending you money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Over a few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it quietly adds a big chunk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.98,0:07:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Most buyers never add it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And here is the painful part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay interest on something that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,loses value every single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your loan costs more,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,while your car is worth less.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So cash is always better,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cash has a hidden cost too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a name most people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,never hear:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,opportunity cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Opportunity cost means what your money
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,could have earned somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Money spent at the showroom cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,also sit in savings,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,earning interest for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,PPF,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the government's long-term savings scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,currently pays 7.1 percent a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Money spent on a car earns
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it shrinks every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So the real comparison is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What rate does the bank charge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you on the loan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And what rate can your saved
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,money safely earn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If the loan costs more than
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,your savings earn,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,paying cash usually wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Every month,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the gap between those rates is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It adds up quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here is the twist most
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,people miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Many say,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will keep my cash in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It will easily beat the loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But market returns are never fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They can go up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and they can fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your EMI,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,though,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes every month,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So comparing a certain loan cost
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,with a hopeful market return is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,risky maths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The loan is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The return is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And cash has its own trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never empty your emergency fund for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If illness or a job loss
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the car will not pay the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So the honest answer is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:10:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay cash only if your emergency
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,money stays untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must borrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,borrow less and keep the loan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,short.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.03,0:10:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the smartest move is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,not about loan or cash at
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the real problem is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.13,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,just the word new?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the mistake most families
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They plan the EMI carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But they never plan the full
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,cost of owning the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And they almost always buy new.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,An American study by the motoring
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,club AAA looked at yearly car
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Depreciation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,service and loan interest made up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about 83 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuel was the small part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of that bill is decided
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the day you choose the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the day you fill petrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So the choice matters more than
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now think about a well-kept car,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:10:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,just 2 to 3 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who already took the biggest fall
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,in value?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The first owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That brutal first-year drop is already
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,paid by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You get a car that still
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,runs well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,at a much lower price.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the bonus answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A lower price means a smaller
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,loan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,or no loan at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It also means less value lost
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,in rupees every year after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your money leaks slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,check it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a trusted mechanic to inspect
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the service record,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and make sure the papers are
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Never skip this step.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you still want a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,new car,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do the maths first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Write down every cost for 5
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,not only the EMI.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask the bank for the total
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,interest in rupees,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,not just the rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That figure alone often changes minds
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,at the showroom desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Every family's income,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,needs and city are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this as a way to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,think,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,not as a fixed rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So back to where we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A 10 lakh car is not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a 10 lakh decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a 5 year money
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.07,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your friend who
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,is booking a new car this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,month.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,should you buy a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,or keep paying rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you buy your last car
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,on a loan or with cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And would you buy used next
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,time?
